!!! oculus/compositor/output.mat
!!! Display output routing.
!!!
!!! Oculus supports multiple displays. Each output has its own
!!! surface and needs its own composition.

book oculus.compositor.output

read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from oculus.compositor.surface
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A display output with its own surface and geometry.

public display-output begin record
    field id as override long
    field surface as surface
    field position as point
    field label as text
    field enabled as boolean
end record
